}}
</syntaxhighlight>

=== Examples ===

Various example codes and their results. For more intricate examples see [[Template:Quote box/examples]]. In the examples the {{tl|lorem ipsum}} template merely generates several lines of sample text without meaning, and is not part of the quote syntax.

